  "full_text": "Okay, so it looks like I am on the throne, or some, what do you call it, mirror image or some weird shit. Anyway, so like a while back I was like, yeah, I want society more localized, a hometown, you know. And like, I noticed the news cycle on the global level is like really narrow. And like I'm going, uh-oh, because I was not sure I was on the throne, right? Yeah, of course, that's exactly what would happen if you localize the shit. The global news disappears, right? And that's pretty much what's happened. There's nothing going on in the world. For everybody, it could be the 1700s and they don't know jack shit about the rest of the world, right? And that's like how the world existed, right? And so I was looking at the global news going, uh-oh, I thought it was something evil, you know? What's up, buddy? Hey, how's it going? I'm doing good. So it looks like everybody's been playing SimCity. So that's good. What? Are you filming? Yes. You want me to film you? No, uh, well, that'd be kind of cool, but, uh... You get better pictures. It's just like right on you. Yeah, okay.",
